# Backup and restore over USB (tools/x0x_backup.py, web/backup; the device's side, a cut cable, a power cut and the
# question: tests/backup_test.c). A backup of a project; the project changed and saved; the backup put back as the
# device does once SEL answers RESTORE FROM USB?: everything as it was, at once and after a reboot. Refused while
# playing (STOP FIRST), when the file is damaged and when it is Polly's: nothing changes. A backup of a project an
# older X0X saved (format 1) restores, and loads as it would at power-on.
wait 300
# the project: a kick on 1, 5, 9 and 13 at 120 BPM, not saved yet: the backup saves it first
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
press HOME
turn SELECT -5
release HOME
expect tempo 120
expect dirty 1
backup proj.x0b
expect dirty 0
# ---- changed and saved: 125 BPM, step 5 off, step 3 on
press HOME
turn SELECT 5
release HOME
tapkey w4
tapkey w2
tap SAVE
reboot
expect tempo 125
expect hit0.0.4 0
expect hit0.0.2 1
# ---- refused while playing: nothing changes
tap PLAY
wait 300
restore proj.x0b
expect restore_rc 10
wait 100
shot stop_first.png
expect tempo 125
tap PLAY
wait 500
# ---- a damaged backup, Polly's: refused, nothing changes
backup other.x0b
backup_damage other.x0b
restore other.x0b
expect restore_rc 5
backup polly.x0b
backup_damage polly.x0b head
restore polly.x0b
expect restore_rc 3
expect tempo 125
expect hit0.0.4 0
# ---- put back: as backed up, at once (reloaded) and after a reboot
restore proj.x0b
expect restore_rc 0
expect tempo 120
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect hit0.0.2 0
expect hit0.0.12 1
expect dirty 0
wait 100
shot restored.png
reboot
expect tempo 120
expect hit0.0.4 1
expect hit0.0.2 0
# ---- a backup of what X0X 0.10 saved (tests/fixtures/v1_store.bin: format 1), restored over this project: loaded
# as at power-on (migrate.x0x), its steps on 1-32, the SD's pots moved for DECAY, the lanes widened, the song
storeload tests/fixtures/v1_store.bin
wait 100
backup v1.x0b
restore proj.x0b
expect restore_rc 0
expect tempo 120
expect songlen 0
restore v1.x0b
expect restore_rc 0
expect pattern 1
expect hit0.0.0 1
expect hit0.0.31 1
expect hit0.0.32 0
expect gate0.0 1
expect sound0.1.3 41
expect sound0.1.4 105
expect laneval0.1.4.5 105
expect laneval0.1.4.40 255
expect songlen 2
expect songbar2.0 16
reboot
expect hit0.0.31 1
expect sound0.1.4 105
expect songlen 2
